    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to stare at a target within Close range. The target must succeed on a Presence Reaction Roll (15) or mark a Stress and become <em>Restrained</em> and <em>Vulnerable</em> until the Goat marks a HP. While <em>Restrained</em> and <em>Vulnerable</em> in this way, they can't target the Goat with attacks or abilities.</p>",
